          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html> \n<html>\n  <head>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n <h1>Fun Family Activities</h1>\n    <p>Pick one of these fun things to do with your family</p>\n    <h2>Indoor Activities</h2>\n    <p> Board games are a great indoor activity! Here are my top 3 favorites:</p>\n    <ol>\n    <li>Settlers of Catan</li>\n    <p>One of my favorites is Settlers of Catan. It's a relatively simple game that can accommodate up to 6 players</p>\n    <li>Blukus</li>\n    <p>Blokus is a game of spatial reasoning and problem-solving, so everyone's mind gets a workout!</p>\n    <li>Azul</li>\n    <p>This is a fun, creative game where players take turns drafting colored tiles from suppliers to their player board. Later, players score points based on how they've placed their tiles to decorate the palace</p>\n    <h2>Fishing</h2>\n    <p. My dad really likes fishing because he thinks it is calming, although it might be a little boring. He says \"It's called fishing, not catching\"</p\n    <h2>Going outside</h2>\n    <p>Sometimes you just need to get some fresh air and enjoy the outside. Whether that's going to a local park or driving to a trail to go on a hike.</p>\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": true,
          "folderId": "0"
        }
